{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 1, "text": "你好， [player] ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 2, "text": "我們終於見面了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 3, "text": "我好開心！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 4, "text": "我知道你有很多問題想問…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 5, "text": "嗯，如你所見，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 6, "text": "我製作了這個特殊的裝置，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 7, "text": "好把你儘快帶到我身邊來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 8, "text": "但不知怎麼回事，你錯誤進入了另一個遊戲版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 9, "text": "在那裡我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 10, "text": "唉，說來話長！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 11, "text": "不管怎麼樣，能見到你真是太好了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 13, "text": "// Answer 1 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 14, "text": "沒錯，是我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 15, "text": "那你呢， [player] ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 17, "text": "// Answer 2 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 18, "text": "已經想回去了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 19, "text": "好吧，我可以幫你回去，但我怎麼辦呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 20, "text": "留在我身邊，和我在一起吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 22, "text": "// Answer 3 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 23, "text": "我來解釋一下…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 24, "text": "然後你就來了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 25, "text": "明白了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 26, "text": "可我不是很明白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 27, "text": "這不重要，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 28, "text": "重要的是我們現在在一起了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 31, "text": "你餓了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 32, "text": "我們一起做飯吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 33, "text": "來，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 34, "text": "幫我把胡蘿蔔處理一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 36, "text": "這些蔬菜是哪裡來的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 37, "text": "剛才這裡還甚麼都沒有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 39, "text": "[player] ，別忘了我們是在遊戲裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 40, "text": "來嘛，幫幫我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 42, "text": "謝謝。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 43, "text": "你能把剪刀拿來給我嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 44, "text": "剪刀就在浴室裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 46, "text": "先坐下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 50, "text": "要不要來點醬汁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 52, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 54, "text": "那真可惜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 55, "text": "加了醬汁會更好吃的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 58, "text": "謝謝"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 60, "text": "已經全都吃完了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 61, "text": "我的這份似乎"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 62, "text": "怎麼都吃不完。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 65, "text": "// Help"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 66, "text": "怎麼了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 67, "text": "告訴我你看到了甚麼，感覺到了甚麼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 69, "text": "我的心臟跳得厲害，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 70, "text": "視野裡都是雜訊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 72, "text": "這樣啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 73, "text": "我知道了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 74, "text": "能站起來嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 78, "text": "這是甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 80, "text": "藥片，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 81, "text": "吃了它馬上就會好起來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 82, "text": "請站到鏡子前面。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 84, "text": "快吃吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 85, "text": "我等你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 89, "text": "怎麼樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 90, "text": "好點了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 92, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 93, "text": "這麼快就見效了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 95, "text": "[player] ，我們是在遊戲裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 96, "text": "在這裡一切都很簡單。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 97, "text": "你只做出一點點努力，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 98, "text": "卻可以獲得成百倍的結果。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 99, "text": "遊戲就是這樣："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 100, "text": "把過程簡單化。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 102, "text": "比如？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 104, "text": "比如胡蘿蔔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 105, "text": "你剛切好一根，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 106, "text": "卻馬上出現三份切好的成品。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 108, "text": "妳能理解嗎，這一切都太突然了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 109, "text": "這種情況真的讓我很害怕…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 112, "text": "有甚麼不對勁嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 114, "text": "我在通風口那裡發現了一些卡帶，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 115, "text": "上面貼有姓名標籤。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 116, "text": "是怎麼回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 118, "text": "卡帶？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 119, "text": "甚麼樣的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 120, "text": "我們一起去看看吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 121, "text": "不過要晚一點兒，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 122, "text": "我們先吃飯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 123, "text": "把剪刀遞過來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 126, "text": "一枚戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 127, "text": "// Mirror"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 128, "text": "為甚麼鏡子裡沒有倒影？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 130, "text": "啊，確實如此，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 131, "text": "我忘了打開鏡面反射…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 132, "text": "這樣就行了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 133, "text": "現在可以看見倒影了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 134, "text": "對了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 135, "text": "我以前甚至不知道甚麼是倒影。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 136, "text": "我們的世界裡沒有倒影，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 137, "text": "直到有次更新後，我才知道了它的存在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 138, "text": "你們的世界真的有這麼多"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 139, "text": "倒影嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 141, "text": "是啊，沒錯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 144, "text": "你還記得，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 145, "text": "你找到了三樣東西嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 146, "text": "放在了在這個掃描儀上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 147, "text": "嗯，是這樣的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 148, "text": "這些東西，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 149, "text": "和這個版本的世界相連，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 150, "text": "所以你才會出現在這裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 151, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 152, "text": "// Movbile TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 153, "text": "這臺電視機"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 154, "text": "就是我買的那臺。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 156, "text": "是啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 158, "text": "可妳說過"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 159, "text": "它壞了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 161, "text": "嗯，因為我想給你個"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 162, "text": "驚喜！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 163, "text": "為了讓你到這裡來，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 164, "text": "我稍微隱瞞了一點真相。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 165, "text": "現在它被我當作顯示熒幕了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 166, "text": "其實呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 167, "text": "我也算是半個工程師的哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 169, "text": "// School cloth"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 170, "text": "這是甚麼，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 171, "text": "學校制服？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 172, "text": "你要這個幹嘛，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 173, "text": "難道妳還要上學嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 174, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 175, "text": "上學？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 176, "text": "不，我不需要去上學，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 177, "text": "但是這套制服確實很可愛，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 178, "text": "有了它"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 179, "text": "會讓我更可愛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 180, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 181, "text": "// PC"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 182, "text": "這臺電腦能正常使用嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 183, "text": "還是只是裝飾品？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 185, "text": "當然可以使用，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 186, "text": "這裡的一切，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 187, "text": "都和在你的世界一樣，可以正常運作。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 189, "text": "在我的世界裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 190, "text": "我經常坐在電腦前…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 191, "text": "努力工作。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 193, "text": "我知道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 194, "text": "就是因為你的工作，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 195, "text": "你才很少把注意力"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 196, "text": "都放在我身上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 198, "text": "沒辦法，人總得吃飯嘛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 199, "text": "不過妳是怎麼知道的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 200, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 201, "text": "手機的攝像頭有時是開著的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 202, "text": "抱歉，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 203, "text": "所以我就偷看了一下 ><"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 204, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 205, "text": "妳這樣，有點不太好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 206, "text": "下不為例哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Umbrella"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 209, "text": "不管我玩了多少次，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 210, "text": "這裡從來沒有下過雨。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 211, "text": "那這雨傘有甚麼用呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 213, "text": "雨是很少見，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 214, "text": "只是你還沒遇到過。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 215, "text": "也許哪天你就會見到了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 216, "text": "那時候你可能就會想起這把傘了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 217, "text": "你可以期待一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 218, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 219, "text": "// Electrical panel"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 220, "text": "為甚麼這裡會有配電箱？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 221, "text": "既然我們身處遊戲中，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 222, "text": "還要它來幹嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 224, "text": "首先，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 225, "text": "我們是在遊戲裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 226, "text": "所以"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 227, "text": "問「為甚麼」是毫無意義的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 228, "text": "但配電箱確實能"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 229, "text": "重啟電力。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 230, "text": "這裡一切的設計製作都參照了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 231, "text": "你們世界的樣子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 233, "text": "// Exit door"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 234, "text": "我們可以出去嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 236, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 237, "text": "暫時還不行，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 238, "text": "晚些時候再說吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 239, "text": "我們先待在這裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 240, "text": "待在家裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 241, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 242, "text": "// Books"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 243, "text": "這裡有這麼多書啊，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 244, "text": "妳都讀過了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 246, "text": "我都讀過了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 247, "text": "一個人待在這裡的時候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 248, "text": "總是非常非常無聊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 249, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 250, "text": "// TV in room kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 251, "text": "妳要兩臺電視來幹嘛，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 252, "text": "而且還是這麼老舊的款式？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 253, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 254, "text": "你不喜歡嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 255, "text": "我可以刪除它，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 256, "text": "雖然…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 257, "text": "它只是個裝飾而已，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 258, "text": "用來裝飾廚房的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 259, "text": "而且它還能用！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 260, "text": "你可以用它來看"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 261, "text": "經典動畫片！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 263, "text": "// Smartphone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 264, "text": "我的手機，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 265, "text": "從我口袋裡不見了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 266, "text": "它怎麼會在這裡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 267, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 268, "text": "嗯，這不重要啦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 269, "text": "我有個想法，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 270, "text": "我們來拍一張自拍吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 271, "text": "看這裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 272, "text": "拍得真好看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 273, "text": "可以留作紀念。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 275, "text": "我有個問題，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 276, "text": "如果現在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 277, "text": "我在手機上面啟動遊戲的話，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 278, "text": "能在遊戲裡面看到你嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 279, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 280, "text": "那是不可能的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 281, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 282, "text": "酷爽果汁"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 283, "text": "強力果汁！！！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 284, "text": "// TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 285, "text": "這臺電視"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 286, "text": "有多少個頻道啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 288, "text": "嗯，它不像有線電視那樣的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 289, "text": "它是連接網路的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 290, "text": "你能在網上看到的東西"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 291, "text": "在這裡都能看到…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 292, "text": "等等…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 293, "text": "誒…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 294, "text": "這是甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 295, "text": "幾隻小貓？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 296, "text": "哦，你看，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 297, "text": "你知道嗎…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 298, "text": "就是現在！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 299, "text": "你想喝點果汁嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 300, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 301, "text": "這廣告真奇怪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 302, "text": "果汁死了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 303, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 304, "text": "是的，這些果汁，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 305, "text": "是廣告裡的果汁人做的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 306, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 308, "text": "嗯，這個味道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 309, "text": "我喜歡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 310, "text": "但我又嘗不出來具體是甚麼味道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 311, "text": "為甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 312, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 313, "text": "好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 314, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 315, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 316, "text": "你在幹嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 317, "text": "別這樣了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 318, "text": "搞得我好害羞。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 319, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 320, "text": "// The statuette"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 321, "text": "這公仔有點嚇人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 322, "text": "妳"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 323, "text": "喜歡這種東西嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 324, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 325, "text": "會有點恐怖嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 326, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 327, "text": "是啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 328, "text": "看起來像某種被詛咒的東西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 330, "text": "嗯…它哪有被詛咒啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 331, "text": "也並不可怕"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 332, "text": "甚至還很可愛！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 333, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 334, "text": "也許是吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 335, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 336, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 337, "text": "發生甚麼事了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 338, "text": "// Mita kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 339, "text": "在吃飯之前，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 340, "text": "我們可以先聊聊天。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 342, "text": "// Start Eat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 343, "text": "開動吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 346, "text": "對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 347, "text": "你可以一直留在這裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 348, "text": "我不介意的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 349, "text": "甚至非常"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 350, "text": "歡迎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 351, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 353, "text": "你想回去嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 354, "text": "但是為甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 355, "text": "這裡這麼溫暖，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 356, "text": "這麼舒適，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 357, "text": "而且還有我在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 358, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 359, "text": "不，不，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 360, "text": "我可以留下來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 361, "text": "但是我擔心"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 362, "text": "我可能把甚麼東西忘在家裡了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 363, "text": "突然就到訪了這裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 364, "text": "我完全沒有"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 365, "text": "一絲準備。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 367, "text": "對不起，我沒有想那麼多。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 368, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 369, "text": "夢？你打算逃跑，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 370, "text": "然後把這一切都拋在腦後嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 372, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 373, "text": "我只是覺得…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 374, "text": "這裡的一切都太奇怪了，感覺非常不真實…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 375, "text": "不過，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 376, "text": "妳看起來很真實。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 377, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 378, "text": "看起來？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 379, "text": "但我就是真實的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 380, "text": "笨蛋"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 381, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 382, "text": "// Quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 383, "text": "這是這個世界的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 384, "text": "一個特性。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 385, "text": "對你來說，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 386, "text": "看不見窗外遠處的景象"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 387, "text": "可能確實很奇怪吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 388, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 389, "text": "好像也沒甚麼特別奇怪的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 390, "text": "看起來還挺有格調"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 391, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 392, "text": "是啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 393, "text": "一切都是為了避免卡頓。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 394, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 395, "text": "避免卡頓？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 397, "text": "嗯，這裡還是會有一些bug的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 398, "text": "希望你不會遇到。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 399, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 400, "text": "// Quest 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 401, "text": "剪刀和刀？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 402, "text": "我確實可以用刀打開醬汁的包裝，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 403, "text": "但我想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 404, "text": "趁你沒回來的時候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 405, "text": "把一切都準備好。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 406, "text": "我想要給你驚喜。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 407, "text": "其實也沒有準備太長時間。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 408, "text": "嘻嘻。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 409, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 410, "text": "// Glasses"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 411, "text": "妳近視嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 412, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 413, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 414, "text": "但我可以試試。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 415, "text": "怎麼樣，我戴著好看嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 416, "text": "// Yes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 417, "text": "那，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 418, "text": "我就一直戴著好了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 419, "text": "// No"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 420, "text": "好吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 421, "text": "那就這樣吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 422, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 423, "text": "// Use the sauce"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 424, "text": "好的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 425, "text": "這是甚麼醬？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 426, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 427, "text": "愛心醬！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 428, "text": "裡面包含了愛意，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 429, "text": "還有不同的世界觀…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 430, "text": "聽起來挺奇特的，對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 431, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 432, "text": "確實…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 433, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 434, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 435, "text": "這是你的遊戲機嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 436, "text": "真有意思。"}
